WEBVTT

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:50.440
DRAGON MASTER GENERAL BARAN

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.860
<i>This is the Dragon Legion's handiwork.</i>

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:59.450
<i>So while we were fighting Flazzard,
they destroyed Carl Kingdom.</i>

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:06.330
The Order of Carl was said
to be the greatest! Dammit!

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.080
I have a request.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:16.670
My brother's corpse should be
around the palace. I'd like to bury him.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.680
My brother was the lead knight
of this kingdom.

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:25.540
The knight Horkins was a hero whose name
was known even in neighboring countries.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:32.650
He fought off the Dragons valiantly,
but the enemy Legion Commander killed him.

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.860
<i>Baran...</i>

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:37.190
I'd never seen anything like it.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.020
<i>My brother matched him
in skill with a sword.</i>

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.590
<i>And then he...</i>

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.470
You sheath your sword?! You coward!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.020
<i>One shot.</i>

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:17.530
<i>With one shot, he killed my brother.</i>

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:23.530
There. I can't get him out alone.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.290
This shape...

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.900
The same shape as Dai's mark.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:38.550
Serve you?! Destroy the human world?!

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:39.670
You must be joking!

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.010
I make no joke about this.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:46.120
It's what the Dragon Knights
were born to do after all.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.310
What?!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:50.060
I see you don't know yet.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:55.230
Very well. I shall tell you
in place of the Dragon Crystal.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.450
<i>Long ago, when the gods
newly created the world,</i>

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:04.330
<i>three races ruled the land.</i>

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:08.030
<i>Specifically, the humans,
Darklings, and Dragons.</i>

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.500
<i>These days Dragons
are considered a type of monster,</i>

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:18.880
<i>but they used to be smarter than humans,
and most of them could speak.</i>

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:26.510
<i>But these three races fought
bloody battles for control of the world.</i>

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:34.040
<i>The gods, lamenting this,
decided someone must oversee this world.</i>

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:41.410
<i>The gods of Dragons, Darklings, and humans
convened and came to a decision.</i>

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:45.370
<i>To create a being with the strength of
Dragons, the Magic Power of Darklings,</i>

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:47.200
<i>and the heart of humans.</i>

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.830
<i>To create the ultimate warrior.</i>

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.250
<i>That is the Dragon Knight.</i>

00:04:55.080 --> 00:05:01.220
<i>Thus, if any race should ever
hold ambitions to dominate the world,</i>

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:07.110
<i>it is the Dragon Knight's duty to wipe
them out and administer divine punishment.</i>

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:11.270
In that case,
isn't Dark King Vearn worse?!

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:14.060
He's trying to conquer the world!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.900
No. The evil is the humans.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:21.450
King Vearn seeks to wipe out the humans
for the sake of the world.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.230
But...

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:27.910
You must promptly embrace
the proper duties of a Dragon Knight

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.680
and offer your power to King Vearn.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:35.330
No! I'm on the humans' side
no matter what anybody says!

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:40.940
I'd rather die than serve the Dark Army
that took Master Avan's life!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:41.840
I see.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.320
Dragon Legion Commander Baran,

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.760
take this!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.140
Avan Strash!

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.480
It has no effect?!

00:05:57.230 --> 00:06:02.110
I'd rather not harm you,
but if this is how you feel...

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:05.130
I will take you with me by force!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.120
<i>Impossible! How can this be?!</i>

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.060
What's going on down there?!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.090
This is...

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:22.690
I sense it. A being with massive power.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:23.590
What?!

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.320
Look! It's Dai!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.220
Dai!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.350
Dai!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:36.100
Dai!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.180
Dai!

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.900
Are you okay?!

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:47.820
That crest...!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.990
Then he's a Dragon Knight, too?!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.370
He's part of the Dark Army!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:57.420
Dragon Legion Commander Baran!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.460
What?!

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.560
Then the Dark Army
has their own Dragon Knight, too?!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:06.420
Impossible! Only one Dragon Knight
is supposed to exist!

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:08.680
Huh? But...

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.880
Correct.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:15.140
I am the one true
Dragon Knight of this age.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:20.690
But, while only one Dragon Knight
is supposed to be born,

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:22.500
there was an exception.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.610
And that is you!

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:29.320
It's time to embrace your duties
as a Dragon Knight

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.180
and destroy the humans with me!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.410
What?!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.330
I'll never do that!
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.700
Things may be all right now.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:44.050
During childhood, a Dragon Knight
is no different from a normal human.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:48.680
But as you grow and begin to exhibit
the Power of Dragons,

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:53.510
the humans will begin to fear,
reject, and persecute you.

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:58.010
When that happens,
you will be the one to suffer.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:02.440
I'm scared! He's scary!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.280
Screw your nonsense! Dai is our friend!

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.400
No matter what he is,
we'll never persecute him!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.330
Help you destroy the humans?!

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.560
Dai would...
Dai would rather die than do that!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.600
Popp...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.630
Princess, cast Fullheal on Dai!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:22.540
Got it!

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:25.020
I'll... I'll try to deal with him!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.090
It's sad to see someone
overestimate themself.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.470
Donk!

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:37.910
Fullheal!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.520
Good! That should heal Dai!

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.470
My greatest spell
that took down three Green Dragons?!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:02.470
You thought a Legion Commander
who leads Dragons to be weaker than one?!

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.670
Princess, hurry!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.910
I'm trying, but...!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.330
Your resistance is futile!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:10.880
My spell!

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:38.240
D-Dammit...

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.120
Dai!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.680
I'm taking the boy.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.350
No! You can't have Dai!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:50.480
You may be the same race, but that
doesn't give you the right to take him!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.360
I do have... the right.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.190
What?!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:57.340
This boy... is my son.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.550
What?

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.970
What did you just say?

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.810
I said this boy is my son.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.730
His real name is Dino.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:14.210
<i>H-He's lying!</i>

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.490
Son? Dai is your son?

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.470
You're saying you're Dai's father?

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.250
Stop lying!

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.890
Dai told me he washed up
on Dermline Island as an infant!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:28.040
Have you got any proof?!

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:32.270
The crest on his forehead is proof itself.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:37.880
Only one person in the world aside from me
could have the Dragon Crest.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:43.120
The son I lost 11 years ago, Dino.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.890
Then, yours is the only
Dragon Knight bloodline?

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.100
No friends or brothers?

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.070
Wait! What about his mother?!

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:54.320
Where is the woman who gave birth to Dai?!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.780
His mother...

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:02.240
Indeed the boy does bear
a resemblance to his mother.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:05.220
However...

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:08.580
that's no concern to you humans.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.170
Astonishing! So Baran is Dai's father?!

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:15.050
It's father and son Dragon Knights!

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:20.510
Correct. It's the tearful reunion
of a father and son in over a decade.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:26.870
But don't forget that I'm the one
who set up this emotional moment.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:32.940
After all, I uncovered the truth
that some coward was hiding.

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.150
Why you...!

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:35.360
Silence!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:40.740
The great Dark King Vearn
shall now grace us with his presence.

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.930
Contain yourselves.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:42.990
My king!

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:43.950
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.660
Dark King Vearn is here.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.710
Well done, all of you.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:00.300
Raise your heads.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:07.220
<i>Up close, the pressure from him
is as powerful as ever.</i>

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.290
I see things are getting interesting.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:17.860
Yes. There has been debate as to
whether or not Dai is a Dragon Knight.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:24.360
Therefore, I went to ascertain
the truth as a neutral party.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:30.080
Commander Hadlar was dead set against it.
Could he have known Dai's identity?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:31.680
<i>These dirty little...</i>

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:37.250
Mystvearn, what do you think
of the boy's power?

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:43.880
I gave Flazzard the most powerful armour
in my army to test Dai's strength.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:48.100
<i>He possesses all manner
of terrifying power.</i>

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:58.590
To think I could have
two Dragon Knights under my command.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:04.130
Baran must be rewarded
if he succeeds in recruiting Dai.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:09.680
Indeed. If he does,
he may take the seat of Dark Commander.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:10.810
King Vearn...!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.960
My decision has been made.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:20.670
<i>What I was afraid of has come true!</i>

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:28.390
<i>So this is why Hadlar was desperate
to keep Dai from Baran.</i>

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:29.390
However...

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:35.060
it seems things will not go that smoothly.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.540
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.590
DARK PUPPETRY AURA HAND

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.570
I'm taking Dino with me.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.160
Don't touch me!

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:50.550
Dai!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.660
Dai!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:58.170
Don't you understand? I'm far stronger
than you could ever hope to be.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:02.250
I still have... my final weapon.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:07.180
<i>That's right. What Matoriv said...</i>

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:09.220
<i>A hero's weapon.</i>

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:15.730
<i>The only weapon I have left
that might work on you...</i>

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.770
<i>is what lets me face any powerful enemy.</i>

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:24.070
<i>It's my courage!</i>

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:31.280
<i>My only hope now
is that Dai defeats Baran.</i>

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:32.410
Dino...

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.910
Don't call me Dino!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.950
My name is Dai!

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.380
It's the name my Grampa gave to me!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:45.440
I fight the Dark Army! I'm Dai, the Hero!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.610
Dai...

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.510
Dai...

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:51.970
Don't!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.850
He's the legendary Dragon Knight!

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.120
But he's evil!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:59.860
Evil? Don't be so sure.

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:06.150
If the Dragon Knight wipes us out,
it would be humanity's own fault.

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.590
But...

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.150
I see. Very well.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:14.350
Then I shall call you
your human name, "Dai."

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:19.210
Dai! I shall defeat you
as a Hero who fights with the humans!

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:23.710
If you will not submit to me,
you shall die!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.430
Popp, here's a Fullheal!

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:30.680
Thanks.

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:34.560
But even if I get
my stamina back, I'm useless.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:38.390
Our spells don't seem to have
any effect on him at all.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.100
Dai, I hope you have a plan!

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:45.070
<i>Any small attack
and he'll kill me for sure.</i>

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:48.690
<i>I'll have to finish him
with my biggest, strongest attack.</i>

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:54.200
I thought you were hiding something,
but I see it's just that.

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:56.950
"Avan Strash," was it?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:03.840
I assume you unite the power, speed,
and Aura control, of your sword skills

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.960
to complete that attack.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:10.300
It requires spirit,
technique, and strength.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:17.390
For a human attack, it's formidable. But
you've already seen it won't work on me.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:22.560
<i>He analyzed Master Avan's greatest attack
with just one hit.</i>

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:24.880
<i>Then I'll have to use that attack.</i>

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:29.530
<i>Please! Power of Dragons
that lies within me!</i>

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.240
<i>Awaken!</i>

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:36.490
<i>If I don't defeat him,
all humanity will be wiped out!</i>

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.120
Dai showed the crest as well!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.040
Could it be...?

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:49.630
Zapple!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.830
Zap Strash!

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:06.360
He blocked it?!
Even though Dai's Strash was perfected?!

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:09.480
He's absorbing the energy
of the Zapple spell with his sword!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.820
Impossible!

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:15.410
Impressive that you can control
the Power of Dragons this much.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:22.160
Normally, a Dragon Knight cannot control
the power of the Crest until fully grown.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:26.500
You've been blessed
with good teachers and good battles.

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:31.710
For that spirit and courage,
I shall show you...

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:38.820
just how terrifying it is when
a true Dragon Knight controls the heavens!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.450
Kazap!

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:54.280
Gigabreak!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.130
Dai!

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:09.880
You monster! How dare you strike Dai!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.420
I may not be able to do any damage, but...

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:13.300
Stop!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:16.260
I shall face that man!

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:19.050
Beast King Crocodine!

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.760
Thank goodness! We're in deep trouble!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.620
<i>So this is the Beast King.</i>

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.180
With you here it's like having an army...

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.810
Big Guy, you're shaking.

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:33.960
Crocodine.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:39.610
Even you should be aware
of what will happen if you fight me.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.370
I'll probably die.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.250
But, that is something I'm prepared to do.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.410
Big Guy...

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.710
Hurry and rescue Dai.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.210
I'll fight with you!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.210
Me too!

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.520
-Don't bother.
-Huh?!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:58.780
I don't know why,
but he's completely immune to spells.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:03.680
The only way to damage him is
with physical attacks by hand or weapon.

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:07.230
Well done, Beast King. So you realized it.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.480
Get Dai.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.770
Got it.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:15.950
You heard everything?

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.010
I heard enough.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.370
Then why stand in my way?

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:22.680
Why should I not reclaim my own son?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.450
Because Dai doesn't want it.

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:29.880
I see. So you've completely
sided with the humans.

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:35.250
How disappointing. Of all the Legion
Commanders, I respected you the most.

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:40.140
That boy, Hyunckel, wasn't bad either.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:43.590
With his hate for humans
in that heart of ice.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:50.810
But, everyone I favor leaves the Dark Amy.
I guess Hadlar just lacks charisma.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.140
That's not true.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.780
I don't know about Hyunckel,

00:19:54.780 --> 00:20:00.450
but I was willing to die
for Hadlar or Dark King Vearn.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:03.860
A true warrior
will sacrifice himself for his master.

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:07.910
All that's changed is that
I now support Dai.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:11.960
And so you would fight me? To protect Dai?

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:18.260
Without Dai, both Hyunckel and I
would have wandered the dark path forever.

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:24.110
He's the sun that brought light
to our hearts of darkness!

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.510
<i>The sun?</i>

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:29.660
All living things need the sun!

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:34.210
None can be allowed to take it away!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:37.110
I may not be strong enough,
but I will still fight!

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:42.030
<i>To move the heart
of one such as Crocodine this much...</i>

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.450
<i>What a child.</i>

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.990
<i>The sun...</i>

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.540
<i>A child of the sun.</i>

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:53.790
<i>Soala...</i>

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.540
Why sheath your sword?!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:01.550
Crocodine,
I see there's no changing your mind.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.430
But if you fight me,

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:07.340
you will learn the terror
of fighting a true Dragon Knight.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:12.600
The completed Power of Dragons
far beyond that of Dai's!

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:21.110
<i>What is this?! His Aura is staggering,
but he's just standing there!</i>

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.240
What's wrong? Won't you fight?

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:30.220
If you won't fight,
I'll just have to claim your head!

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:40.130
<i>I-Impossible!
My axe is the one that shattered!</i>

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:42.430
What's this?!

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:45.720
This is the secret
to the Dragon Knights' supremacy.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.340
The Draconic Aura!

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.100
Big Guy!

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:25.840
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:25.840
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:36.060
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:36.060
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:44.020
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:44.020
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:46.570
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:46.570
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:52.700
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:52.700
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:57.540 --> 00:23:01.580
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:22:57.540 --> 00:23:01.580
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:13.890
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:13.890
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:19.180
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:19.180
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:35.830
<i>Baran is Dai's father.</i>

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:41.540
<i>Dai pushes aside his doubts and fights,
but cannot defeat Baran's Gigabreak.</i>

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:45.210
<i>Crocodine joins in,
but fails to even scratch Baran.</i>

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:48.460
<i>Therein lies the secret
to the Dragon Knights' supremacy.</i>

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:53.390
<i>As Dai still stands up to face him,
Baran's Crest shines eerily.</i>

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:55.890
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:58.140
<i>"The Terrifying Draconic Aura"</i>

00:23:58.310 --> 00:24:00.560
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
